{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026aUU35lzRVz1794440595.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>TikTok母公司字節跳動，據報將於未來幾星期內，推出一款AI人工智能代理，類似Facebook母公司Meta的Muse，目標在三年內，縮短與美國頂尖AI企業的差距。</p><p></p><p>《彭博》報道，字節跳動聯合創始人張一鳴，在最近一次AI團隊全員會議上，向研究人員、工程師及支援人員介紹了有關計劃，並提出幾項重點任務，包括公司可以在AI前沿，與Anthropic及OpenAI等業界領導者競爭，並要求最少在2029年至2030年實現目標。</p><p></p><p>張一鳴在會上重申，不應依賴蒸鎦技術，即利用更大模型的輸出，來訓練及改進較小模型，必須著眼長遠發展。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T00:46:41.887522+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":261,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T23:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T10:17:26.057230+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T00:39:58.715520+00:00","content_hash":"e82bdbb5a94b2e627d48cfba23d9d24c47e18af38e549733b175c7dbb79fb1e2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T00:46:41.887522+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}